        "text": "Calendar verification limitation: the official CMS announcement archive lists June 2026 released September 25, 2026, but exposes no scheduled August 2026 publication date. December 15, 2026 is retained solely as the contractual resolutionDate; it could not be verified from an official release calendar or announcement this run. The mandatory date-verification requirement therefore remains unmet. Source: https://www.medicaid.gov/medicaid-and-chip-eligibility-operations-and-enrollment-snapshot."
